{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to discuss a focused day or small series to steady habits, outcomes, and daily frameworks." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f6f7f8; --card:#ffffff; --muted:#6b7280; --brand:#0f766e; --accent:#7dd3fc; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --radius:14px; --shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial; color:#0f172a;background:var(--bg);}
    .site-wrap{min-height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
    header{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.8), rgba(255,255,255,0.85));backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.04);}
    .nav{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px;}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand)}
    .brand .logo{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand),#34d399);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:#0f172a;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}
    nav a.active{background:rgba(15,118,110,0.08);color:var(--brand)}
    main{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:26px;align-items:start}

    /* Pattern header */
    .hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.8) 40%);border-radius:18px;padding:26px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    .hero:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');opacity:0.06;mix-blend-mode:overlay;}

    .hero h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:20px}
    .hero p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .comparator{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .toggle{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
    .switch{width:56px;height:28px;border-radius:999px;background:#e6eef0;position:relative;cursor:pointer}
    .knob{width:22px;height:22px;background:white;border-radius:50%;position:absolute;top:3px;left:4px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(2,6,23,0.08);transition:all .28s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1)}
    .switch.on{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#34d399,#06b6d4)}
    .switch.on .knob{left:30px}
    .tiers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}
    .tier{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),rgba(250,250,250,0.6));}
    .price{font-weight:700;color:var(--brand);font-size:18px}
    .per{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Mood to Method */
    .mood{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .moods{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .mood button{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,0.06);background:white;cursor:pointer}
    .mood button.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ccfbf1,#ecfeff);border-color:rgba(15,118,110,0.12)}
    .recommend{padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfeff);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(10,20,30,0.04)}
    .cta{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--brand);color:white;text-decoration:none}

    /* Form */
    form .row{display:flex;gap:8px}
    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(2,6,23,0.06);font-size:14px}
    button.primary{background:var(--brand);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:0}

    footer{max-width:1100px;margin:30px auto;padding:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    @media (max-width:920px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:16px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="site-wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="nav">
        <div class="brand"><div class="logo">W</div><div>
          <div style="font-size:15px">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div></div>
        <nav>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="about.html">Approach</a></li>
            <li><a href="services.html">Offerings</a></li>
            <li><a href="programs.html">Programs</a></li>
            <li><a href="pricing.html">Rates</a></li>
            <li><a href="testimonials.html">Stories</a></li>
            <li><a href="book.html">Book</a></li>
            <li><a class="active" href="contact.html">Connect</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section>
        <div class="hero card">
          <h1>Reach out and choose the right next step</h1>
          <p class="lead">Short conversations, focused days, and multi-session paths that reconfigure habits and outcomes without medical promises — only practice and structure.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="height:18px"></div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">How to connect</h3>
          <p class="muted">Share a few notes here and we’ll propose whether a single intensive, a short series, or a sustain plan fits your current state.</p>

          <form id="contactForm" style="margin-top:12px" action="#" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();alert('Form submitted — integrate with server.');">
            <div style="margin-bottom:8px"><label class="muted">Name</label><input name="name" placeholder="Your name" required></div>
            <div style="margin-bottom:8px"><label class="muted">Email</label><input name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required></div>
            <div style="margin-bottom:8px"><label class="muted">Phone</label><input name="phone" placeholder="{{PHONE}}"></div>
            <div style="margin-bottom:8px"><label class="muted">Tell me about right now</label><textarea name="note" rows="4" placeholder="What's the most immediate challenge?"></textarea></div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px">
              <button class="primary" type="submit">Send inquiry</button>
              <a id="dynamicCta" class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <div style="height:18px"></div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">Mood → Method</h3>
          <p class="muted">Pick how you feel right now. The recommendation will adapt and the action button will change to match the suggested next step.</p>

          <div class="mood">
            <div class="moods" role="tablist" aria-label="Mood selector">
              <button data-key="overloaded">Overloaded</button>
              <button data-key="drained">Drained</button>
              <button data-key="ready">Ready to act</button>
              <button data-key="curious">Curious, not sure</button>
            </div>

            <div id="recommend" class="recommend">
              <strong id="recTitle">Choose a mood</strong>
              <p id="recBody" class="muted" style="margin-top:6px">Selection updates suggested format and the CTA wording.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="height:18px"></div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">Compare rates</h3>
          <p class="muted">Toggle between recurring monthly options and package pricing. Numbers animate to show transitions clearly.</p>

          <div class="comparator">
            <div class="toggle">
              <div class="muted">Monthly</div>
              <div id="pricingToggle" class="switch" role="switch" aria-checked="false" tabindex="0" aria-label="Toggle pricing view"><div class="knob"></div></div>
              <div class="muted">Package</div>
            </div>

            <div class="tiers" id="tiers">
              <div class="tier"><div>
                <div style="font-size:13px;color:#0f172a">Foundation Series</div>
                <div class="per">Small habits, steady outcomes</div>
              </div><div>
                <div class="price" data-month="120" data-package="990">$120</div>
                <div class="per">/mo</div>
              </div></div>

              <div class="tier"><div>
                <div style="font-size:13px;color:#0f172a">Momentum Plan</div>
                <div class="per">Four-week bundled path</div>
              </div><div>
                <div class="price" data-month="320" data-package="2590">$320</div>
                <div class="per">/mo</div>
              </div></div>

              <div class="tier"><div>
                <div style="font-size:13px;color:#0f172a">Singular Shift (VIP Day)</div>
                <div class="per">One focused session</div>
              </div><div>
                <div class="price" data-month="1200" data-package="3300">$1200</div>
                <div class="per">/day</div>
              </div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">Contact details</h4>
          <p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 8px">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a><br>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
          <p class="muted">Office: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
        </div>

        <div style="height:12px"></div>

        <div class="card">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px">Quick actions</h4>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
            <a class="cta" href="book.html">Request a VIP day</a>
            <a class="cta" href="programs.html">Explore short series</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div>© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} · Built with clear frameworks and measurable habits · <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a></div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Pricing toggle
    (function(){
      const toggle = document.getElementById('pricingToggle');
      const prices = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.price'));
      let state = 'monthly'; // monthly or package

      function animateNum(el, start, end, dur, suffix){
        const startTime = performance.now();
        function step(now){
          const t = Math.min(1, (now - startTime)/dur);
          const eased = 1 - Math.pow(1 - t, 3);
          const val = Math.round(start + (end - start) * eased);
          el.textContent = '$' + val + (suffix||'');
          if(t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);
        }
        requestAnimationFrame(step);
      }

      function setView(to){
        const isPkg = to === 'package';
        toggle.classList.toggle('on', isPkg);
        toggle.setAttribute('aria-checked', isPkg ? 'true' : 'false');
        prices.forEach(p => {
          const month = parseInt(p.getAttribute('data-month'), 10);
          const pack = parseInt(p.getAttribute('data-package'), 10);
          const cur = parseInt(p.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,''),10) || (isPkg ? month : pack);
          const target = isPkg ? pack : month;
          const per = p.nextElementSibling;
          per.textContent = isPkg ? '' : '/mo';
          // change per for VIP day
          if(p.parentElement.parentElement.querySelector('.per') && p.parentElement.parentElement.querySelector('.per').textContent.indexOf('/day')!==-1){
            // keep day label
            per.textContent = isPkg ? '' : '/day';
          }
          animateNum(p, cur, target, 450);
        });
        state = to;
      }

      toggle.addEventListener('click', ()=>{setView(state==='monthly'?'package':'monthly');});
      toggle.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{ if(e.key==='Enter' || e.key===' ') { e.preventDefault(); setView(state==='monthly'?'package':'monthly'); }});

      // initialize with monthly
      prices.forEach(p=>{
        const m = p.getAttribute('data-month');
        p.textContent = '$' + m;
      });
    })();

    // Mood-to-Method behaviour
    (function(){
      const mapping = {
        overloaded: {
          title: 'Short triage + 60-minute plan',
          body: 'When there is too much on the list, a focused hour to triage priorities and secure the next week with a handful of sustainable habits helps you act, not just react.',
          cta: 'Book a triage session',
          href: 'book.html#triage'
        },
        drained: {
          title: 'Recovery rhythm (three sessions)',
          body: 'If energy is low, a brief series that rebuilds morning and evening micro-routines creates the scaffolding for steadier days and reliable outputs.',
          cta: 'Start a short series',
          href: 'programs.html#recovery'
        },
        ready: {
          title: 'VIP day — one clear reset',
          body: 'For a quick, powerful pivot, a single intensive day designs new patterns, practices, and a follow-up plan to hold gains in the weeks after.',
          cta: 'Reserve a VIP day',
          href: 'book.html#vip'
        },
        curious: {
          title: 'Exploratory conversation',
          body: 'Not sure where to begin? A short exploratory call maps options and aligns a plan that fits the current season of life and work.',
          cta: 'Schedule a call',
          href: 'book.html#call'
        }
      };

      const buttons = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.moods button'));
      const titleEl = document.getElementById('recTitle');
      const bodyEl = document.getElementById('recBody');
      const ctaBtn = document.getElementById('dynamicCta');

      buttons.forEach(btn=>{
        btn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
          buttons.forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active'));
          btn.classList.add('active');
          const key = btn.getAttribute('data-key');
          const data = mapping[key];
          if(data){
            // morph content
            titleEl.textContent = data.title;
            bodyEl.textContent = data.body;
            // update CTA text and link
            ctaBtn.textContent = data.cta;
            ctaBtn.setAttribute('href', data.href + '?utm_source=mood');

            // subtle animation: flash background
            const rec = document.getElementById('recommend');
            rec.animate([{background:'#fff'},{background:'#f0fffb'},{background:'#fff'}],{duration:420});
          }
        });
      });

      // Keyboard access
      buttons.forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{ if(e.key==='Enter'){ b.click(); }}));
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and notes for chunk 4

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html — Contact/connect page with two interactive widgets and accessible layout.

Purpose and features
- A compact contact page meant for the wellness coach site (layoutFamily: clinic_modern).
- Interactive components implemented with local JS (no external libraries):
  - Pricing Comparator: toggle between monthly and package pricing. Prices animate between values to make the transition clear.
  - Mood-to-Method selector: pick a current mood (Overloaded, Drained, Ready to act, Curious). The recommendation card morphs copy, the CTA label updates, and the CTA link receives a query tag for traceability.

Accessibility and behaviour
- Toggle is keyboard operable (Enter/Space) and uses aria-checked.
- Mood buttons are focusable and respond to Enter.
- The form submission is stubbed (prevents default) and displays a placeholder alert — replace with real endpoint integration.

Placeholders to replace in your environment
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Integration notes
- The page references an SVG pattern at assets/img/pattern.svg for subtle background texture. Ensure the asset exists in that path.
- The dynamic CTA initially displays the placeholder label {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} and points to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}. The Mood-to-Method widget will overwrite both text and href when a mood is selected.
- Pricing amounts are embedded as data attributes on .price elements: data-month and data-package. The small animation interpolates integer prices.

Testing
- Open contact.html in a browser.
- Toggle the pricing switch — prices animate.
- Click a mood button — recommendation and CTA update. Verify the CTA href changes (it appends a utm_source=mood tag).
- Tab through controls to confirm keyboard accessibility.

Developer notes
- No external fonts, CDN, or images beyond the local SVG pattern are used.
- Copy avoids medical claims; phrasing focuses on habits, frameworks, and outcomes.
- To wire form to a server, replace the form onsubmit handler with fetch/XHR to your API endpoint.

End of chunk 4 README."}
